dlIcY3dDvqumf1wKjup2RyhdQZUvWI9Fu-TfbWtK03m2tvGndmebPfOJIVzYu-mwoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxe9He8Qxb7ky_NPQgJeCVm6GPo1F_rGsrQ9G6gcTQ4-g&oe=69B02737"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=loydZzC3PEUQ7kNvwFK69yg&_nc_oc=AdlkM88eweBk9vYI0SEpMb7_ntmf2CacHbGh1bXZvi1creYrXW8LbT6wuZqNry_SRmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz-ZhaGtuN-ghoPhB2p4A3fTlI7t8fNCQ5USAJ_lydLjg&oe=69B028CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s5tQgbU95sEQ7kNvwG__oiY&_nc_oc=AdlD2U5eHIraLqgBs1eGKqs7YMxbe5Gr_uyPcmo4M02uX7nA9SuS_A3lC-TGyVl5Sqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5WnGjcUmNQ1iZdqafdZv1ZI4W4WzBIXOSkzbcC6rhnA&oe=69B015EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TObo1biV4PoQ7kNvwGlqeno&_nc_oc=AdkTkKGXwj0_k86NFOSGuVBVSVXOAsC_IQfkn2GRer_BtZ6ZSIycLn_9kVqwulWs-Ww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzlNUCml3IYLopFWGKhGveJ2CTUxtypIXlMRzV7Elx_yA&oe=69AFFF43"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y2wvuMqBRC8Q7kNvwG6bklk&_nc_oc=Admr_OKWk6w5RrobPyh5N_UP-et4UiUartJFLYIBLMZemJuNovi30XP0SmmpfpVndlc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxpsMpDC44loWJRz_7Ihix6YPLnvwfDriiDTJPhvY0cCA&oe=69AFF798"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=veMVQAw0p5IQ7kNvwGVywtd&_nc_oc=AdnLuFakjX3CyQKycAvhWeg9S1fIGQ8nOT81snZueuT_FhS42uoR-RQnQFporoso0kE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyuQupL0f_2PakKf48RhZ8GzeJFSR_0fr9hFQwxQXeCLA&oe=69B00ABC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_6208099537495751086_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&