2131092734129191", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622166_2131092737462524_8680641054341149174_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OV2c4yrbYLMQ7kNvwHojMrO&_nc_oc=AdlIcY3dDvqumf1wKjup2RyhdQZUvWI9Fu-TfbWtK03m2tvGndmebPfOJIVzYu-mwoo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxe9He8Qxb7ky_NPQgJeCVm6GPo1F_rGsrQ9G6gcTQ4-g&oe=69B02737"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=loydZzC3PEUQ7kNvwFK69yg&_nc_oc=AdlkM88eweBk9vYI0SEpMb7_ntmf2CacHbGh1bXZvi1creYrXW8LbT6wuZqNry_SRmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz-ZhaGtuN-ghoPhB2p4A3fTlI7t8fNCQ5USAJ_lydLjg&oe=69B028CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s5tQgbU95sEQ7kNvwG__oiY&_nc_oc=AdlD2U5eHIraLqgBs1eGKqs7YMxbe5Gr_uyPcmo4M02uX7nA9SuS_A3lC-TGyVl5Sqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz5WnGjcUmNQ1iZdqafdZv1ZI4W4WzBIXOSkzbcC6rhnA&oe=69B015EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current 